cing directly forward with a calm, introspective expression. Her posture is upright and symmetrical, with her shoulders relaxed and her arms appearing to rest naturally downward outside the lower edge of the frame. She has a slim build, an elongated oval face, smooth light-to-medium skin tone, softly defined cheekbones, a narrow chin, and a composed gaze directed toward the viewer. Her eyes are almond-shaped with dark pupils and softly shaded eyelids; the eyeliner and lashes are minimal and delicate. A small brown mole is visible on her right temple area near the outer brow region, and another lighter speck appears on her left cheek area. Her eyebrows are thin, arched, and neatly shaped, drawn with fine dark strokes. Her nose is slender and straight, indicated by restrained shading rather than heavy outline. Her lips are softly closed and colored with muted peach lipstick, giving the face a quiet, understated emotional tone. She wears minimal makeup overall, with subtle shading around the eyes and a matte, natural finish on the skin. Her hair is dark black, gathered loosely into a high bun at the crown-back of the head. The hairstyle is informal and slightly windswept, with many fine loose strands and wisps falling around the forehead, temples, ears, and sides of the face. A pale white hairpin passes horizontally through the bun, extending to both sides; it is simple, cylindrical, lightly shaded, and slightly angled relative to the head. The hair is painted with layered dark washes, dry-brush textures, and scattered thin black lines that create a sense of movement and fragility. She wears a traditional robe resembling a hanfu, with crossed lapels over the chest and wide, flowing sleeves. The garment is predominantly black and charcoal gray, with soft translucent washes and textured brushwork. The inner collar and lapel edges show muted beige-gray fabric beneath the darker outer layer. The neckline forms overlapping diagonal bands across the upper torso, emphasizing 